     * Safely expands archive entries into the specified target directory.
     *
     * <p>This implementation uses {@link Path} APIs to resolve and normalize entry paths,
     * ensuring that no entry can escape the target directory via path‑traversal
     * sequences such as {@code "../"} or absolute paths. It also performs a
     * canonical path check after resolving the entry to guard against symlink
     * attacks and other edge cases.</p>
